      "source": "Composite <a href=\"IndexResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>IndexResolver</code></a> implementation that iterates over a given collection of delegate\n<a href=\"IndexResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>IndexResolver</code></a> instances. <br/>\n<br/>\n<strong>NOTE</strong> <a href=\"IndexedData.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>IndexedData</code></a> created by an <a href=\"IndexResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>IndexResolver</code></a> can be overwritten by subsequent\n<a href=\"IndexResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>IndexResolver</code></a>.",
